==Trivia==
*In ''[[RuneScape Classic]]'', this prayer is known as "Paralyze Monster". It requires a [[Prayer]] level of 37 to use and is 100% effective on all [[NPCs]] (since NPCs do not use [[Magic]] or [[Ranged]] on RSC). This prayer does not work on players in the [[Wilderness]] or in duels.

